[36m(LLMRayActor pid=2120834)[0m 2026-09-04 00:45:51 - WARNING - vllm_utils.py:1361 - Step 'bash' timed out after 120.0s. Args: {'command': 'python3 -c "\nfrom scipy.integrate import solve_ivp\nimport re\n\nwith open(\'/home/user/sequences.fasta\', \'r\') as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\nseq_blocks = re.findall(r\'>(.+)\\\\n([A-Z]+)\', content)\n\ndef ode(t, y, p):\n    A, B, C = y\n    return [-p*A + 1e4*B*C, p*A - 1e4*B*C - 3e7*B**2, 3e7*B**2]\n\nresults = {}\nfor seq_id, seqlen in seq_blocks:\n    # Simple calculation of GC content\n    gc = sum(1 for c in seqlen[1].upper() if c in \'GC\') / len(seqlen[1])\n    p = gc * 0.1\n    print(f\'{seq_id}: p={p:.6f}, max_time=1e10\')\n    \n    # Try with adaptive method that handles long time spans\n    # Use BDF with initial step size control\n    try:\n        sol = solve_ivp(ode, [0, 1e10], [1.0, 0.0, 0.0], args=(p,),\n                       method=\'BDF\', max_step=0.5, rtol=1e-8, atol=1e-10)\n        results[seq_id] = list(sol.y[:, -1])\n        print(f\'  Final: A={sol.y[0,-1]:.6e}, B={sol.y[1,-1]:.6e}, C={sol.y[2,-1]:.6e}\')\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\'  Error: {e}\')\n\nimport json\nwith open(\'/home/user/pathway_results.json\', \'w\') as f:\n    json.dump(results, f, indent=2)\nprint(\'Done\')\n" 2>&1'}
