[36m(LLMRayActor pid=2120834)[0m 2026-09-04 01:41:02 - WARNING - vllm_utils.py:1361 - Step 'bash' timed out after 120.0s. Args: {'command': 'python3 << \'PYEOF\'\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.integrate import solve_ivp\nimport json\nimport re\n\ndef ode_system(t, y, p):\n    A, B, C = y\n    dA_dt = -p * A + 1e4 * B * C\n    dB_dt = p * A - 1e4 * B * C - 3e7 * B**2\n    dC_dt = 3e7 * B**2\n    return [dA_dt, dB_dt, dC_dt]\n\ndef solve_for_sequence(p, t_end):\n    """Solve the ODE for given p and save results"""\n    t_span = [0, t_end]\n    y0 = [1.0, 0.0, 0.0]\n    \n    # Use BDF method for stiff systems\n    try:\n        sol = solve_ivp(ode_system, t_span, y0, args=(p,), \n                        method=\'BDF\', max_step=1e3, \n                        rtol=1e-9, atol=1e-12, dense_output=True)\n        print(f"p={p}: Success, steps={len(sol.t)}, final_t={sol.t[-1]}")\n        return sol.y[:, -1] if len(sol.t) > 0 else None\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f"p={p}: Error - {e}")\n        return None\n\n# Test with seq_alpha (p = 0.1)\nprint("Testing with p = 0.1:")\nresult = solve_for_sequence(0.1, 1e10)\nif result is not None:\n    print(f"Final: A={result[0]}, B={result[1]}, C={result[2]}")\nPYEOF'}
